Better Days for Sunrise (version 0.5.0)

A port of Better Days 4.1.1.7 by wendall911.
Original source: https://github.com/wendall911/BetterDays
Original licence: LGPL-3.0-or-later

Ported to Minecraft 26.3 by lavoide and to Sunrise by arismoko: the rules are re-implemented in Rust on
Sunrise's mod API (no Java code is included). This port is distributed under the same licence as
the original (LGPL-3.0-or-later); the licence text is in LICENSE. The in-bed clock uses the
original's mod icon as its own icon.

LICENSE and COPYING.LESSER are the original's files; COPYING is the GNU GPL v3 text the LGPL builds on.
